      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOHO TRUMP (1) came from wider than this when he faded out of his semi final but had kicked off his campaign with two wins, one at Menangle and the other in the heats of this series. Led in both of those so has the speed to take advantage of the ace draw. Won the final of this series last year and can find some consolation here. Stablemate SOHO PARK AVENUE (9) was held up late last start but had recorded a string of top-two results prior including a Menangle win and a second to SOHO TRUMP when starting from this barrier in the heats. Player with some luck. STAR VISION (6) had a tough draw when midfield to SOHO TRUMP last start. That was his first defeat in four starts and he hails from a leading yard so could bounce back. SEASIDE BOY (4) draws better than when midfield last start and had recorded a string of wins and placings prior including a fighting win from the back row here two back.",
